 ■ gamma                                 a                                     ┃
 ■ runner                                                                      ┃
 ■ ui                                                                          ┃
                                                                               ┃
                                                                               ┃
                                                                               ┃
                                                                               ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] unflag, [C-t] tags: a                                      ┃
```

